<!-- Preferences > Charis (research/248 7.3, research/263, prefs-charis-tabs, research/266 prefs-frame): Charis's own
     settings, the ones that were in the Charis menu and the switch of RLVa (plus/rlv), on sub-tabs: a plus_ps_tabs on
     top (the official tab container, so the preferences' search opens a sub-tab with a match; each page's label and
     tool_tip are its tab's). The class remembers the sub-tab picked in PlusPrefsCharisTab. The class
     plus_panel_preference_charis (plus/prefscharis) is an LLPanelPreference: the controls with a control_name, on
     every page, are saved when the floater opens and restored on Cancel; the items driven by a feature's registered
     functions (commit_callback here; their state is read by the class through the same functions, for the page
     shown) act at once, and so do the MCP switches and the FPS display (the class's IMMEDIATE).
     Size (1080 base; a preferences page, research/266 3. and plus/prefscharis/prefs_tab_template.xml): 574 x 515;
     the sub-tabs' strip 36 at the top 4, the pages under it 475 high, each a scroll_container (574) with a panel 557
     wide (574 less the scroll bar 15 and the border 2) and as high as its rows. Headings 40, checks 30, buttons 40,
     drop-down rows 33, notes 18, 10 between sections, 6 before buttons, 10 above and 14 below. The pages: display 241, graphics 285, controls 302, ai 130, rlva 266, other 282,
     so none scrolls at the default size (they do in a window made shorter). Rows are 529 wide; ja lines are at
     most 38 characters (529 less the check box, / 13). -->
